/**
 * 1.20.1's static factories of the vanilla trigger instances, ported as 1.20.1 wrote them
 * (staticRedirects, generated by core/tools/gen_s1adv.py from the damage table; same name and
 * descriptor as the 1.20.1 method).
 *
 * 1.20.2's factories of the same names answer a Criterion and take other arguments (an Optional
 * where 1.20.1 took a predicate that may be ANY, a builder where it took a built predicate), and a
 * few were renamed onto other bodies; delegating to them would carry those changes along. Each
 * port builds the 1.20.2 instance from exactly what the 1.20.1 body passed to the instance's
 * constructor -- every ANY an absent Optional (CbAdvAny), every wrapped entity predicate wrapped
 * by 1.20.1's rules -- and records the trigger the 1.20.1 instance named (its id was the
 * constructor's first argument or the class's constant), which is what a 1.20.1 caller later reaches
 * through getCriterion() or hands to Advancement.Builder.addCriterion.
 */
